# API and Security

- Confirm all API calls are secured with Cognito.
- No API endpoint should allow unauthorized access unless explicitly required and documented in the architecture.
- Validate authentication and authorization paths for every new or modified API call.
- Do not assume frontend checks are sufficient for security. Backend/API authorization must be enforced server-side.
